              "text": "<h1><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Virtual Monitoring</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Scale care provider resources</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">A virtual care provider works from the virtual command center observing or monitoring multiple patients or environments at one time.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
