          "topMargin": "3",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Help return time to nurses<sup>1</sup></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">One U.S. research study demonstrates how task delegation through tech enablement for virtual nursing, virtual monitoring and ambient monitoring can help bedside care team members reclaim time and help close the workforce gap.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 28 2025 17:04:33 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
