          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Potential workforce gap closure of <span class=\"futura-bold\">up to 300,000 nurses</span> by freeing up time through tech enablement and task delegation<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
