          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Conservative estimate of potential <span class=\"futura-bold\">15% net time savings</span> through task delegation or tech enablement<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
